WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.285
Choose Sign in with your browser.

2
00:00:04.417 --> 00:00:09.704
Scry Sync shows a short code and opens a
sign-in page in your browser.

3
00:00:10.274 --> 00:00:16.280
Type that code into the page, then choose
the project your pictures should go to.

4
00:00:17.485 --> 00:00:21.920
Choose Continue, and Scry Sync signs in on
its own.
